// 击杀计分：基础分 + 连杀倍率（3.2s 内连续击杀叠加），并在击杀点飘出 3D 加分数字。
import {
  CanvasTexture,
  SRGBColorSpace,
  Sprite,
  SpriteMaterial,
} from "../vendor/three-r180.js";

const POINTS = { gull: 100, hound: 250 },
  COMBO_WINDOW = 3.2,
  MAX_POPS = 14,
  LIFE = 1.15;

export function createScore(context) {
  const state = { total: 0, combo: 0, comboT: 0 },
    pops = [],
    free = [];

  function emit() {
    try {
      context.hud && context.hud.setScore && context.hud.setScore(state.total, state.combo);
    } catch {}
  }

  function spawn(pos, text, tone) {
    let p = free.pop();
    if (!p) {
      if (pops.length >= MAX_POPS) return;
      const canvas = document.createElement("canvas");
      canvas.width = 512;
      canvas.height = 128;
      const tex = new CanvasTexture(canvas),
        sprite = new Sprite(
          new SpriteMaterial({
            map: tex,
            transparent: !0,
            depthWrite: !1,
            depthTest: !1,
            toneMapped: !1,
          }),
        );
      (tex.colorSpace = SRGBColorSpace),
        (sprite.renderOrder = 30),
        (p = { sprite, canvas, ctx: canvas.getContext("2d"), tex });
    }

    const { ctx, canvas } = p;
    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
    ctx.font = "700 76px 'Barlow Condensed', system-ui, sans-serif";
    ctx.textAlign = "center";
    ctx.textBaseline = "middle";
    ctx.lineWidth = 16;
    ctx.strokeStyle = "rgba(6,8,10,0.88)";
    ctx.strokeText(text, canvas.width / 2, canvas.height / 2);
    ctx.fillStyle = tone === "hound" ? "#ffd166" : "#93e6a6";
    ctx.fillText(text, canvas.width / 2, canvas.height / 2);
    p.tex.needsUpdate = !0;

    (p.sprite.position.copy(pos),
      (p.sprite.position.y += 0.55),
      (p.sprite.position.x += (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6),
      (p.sprite.position.z += (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6),
      (p.sprite.scale.set(1.15, 0.29, 1)),
      (p.sprite.material.opacity = 1),
      (p.sprite.visible = !0),
      (p.life = 0),
      (p.vy = 1.15),
      context.scene.add(p.sprite),
      pops.push(p));
  }

  function update(dt) {
    for (let i = pops.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      const p = pops[i],
        k = (p.life += dt) / LIFE;
      if (k >= 1) {
        (context.scene.remove(p.sprite),
          p.sprite.visible = !1,
          pops.splice(i, 1),
          free.push(p));
        continue;
      }
      (p.sprite.position.y += p.vy * dt),
        (p.vy *= 1 - 1.8 * dt),
        (p.sprite.material.opacity = k < 0.6 ? 1 : 1 - (k - 0.6) / 0.4);
      const s = 1 + Math.min(0.2, p.life * 0.55);
      p.sprite.scale.set(1.15 * s, 0.29 * s, 1);
    }

    if (state.comboT > 0) {
      state.comboT -= dt;
      state.comboT <= 0 && ((state.combo = 0), emit());
    }
  }

  context.events.on("enemy:killed", (k) => {
    if (!context.game || context.game.state !== "playing") return;
    const type = (k && (k.type || (k.enemy && k.enemy.type))) || "gull",
      base = POINTS[type] || 100;
    state.combo = state.comboT > 0 ? Math.min(9, state.combo + 1) : 1;
    state.comboT = COMBO_WINDOW;
    const gain = Math.round(base * Math.min(4, 1 + (state.combo - 1) * 0.5));
    state.total += gain;
    k && k.pos && spawn(k.pos, state.combo > 1 ? `+${gain} ×${state.combo}` : `+${gain}`, type);
    if (state.combo >= 3 && context.hud && context.hud.warn) {
      context.hud.warn(`${state.combo} 连杀`, 1.8);
    }
    emit();
  });

  return {
    update,
    get total() {
      return state.total;
    },
    get combo() {
      return state.combo;
    },
    reset() {
      (state.total = 0), (state.combo = 0), (state.comboT = 0), emit();
    },
  };
}
